"P1866417107" "Coordinate storage mainframe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P618586309" "You were able to keep the Rikti from stealing information and kidnapping researchers, but they've already taken key hardware."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4016237911" "Your overall success was quite impressive. The Rikti did manage to get away with important portal technology, but without the databases and captives, they will not be able to use it effectively. However, they may still have enough information to begin opening portals of their own. I hope that I will be able to count on your continued assistance in preventing an interdimensional Rikti breakout. <br><br>I am especially glad that you were able to prevent the abduction of the researchers. The Rikti would no doubt have used an alteration process on them to ensure their cooperation. The Rikti's transformation process can be extremely traumatic, even to a prepared mind, and retaining human thought patterns is difficult. On their behalf, I'd like to extend my personal thanks."
// RandomFameString :
"P910250574" "I heard that {HeroName} has put a dent in Rikti's homeworld travel plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4178072380" "A portal research team recently reported contact with Rikti on an alternate world they've been trying to regain contact with. The energy cost to cross over to this particular world is low, making it nearby, dimensionally speaking. The legal representatives of that world have requested our aid in preventing the Rikti from entering their world. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I have been authorized to pass that request on to you, and formally ask that you remove the Rikti threat from this alternate world.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1269529571" "Remove the Rikti threat from an alternate Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P1175478810" "I'm glad that you have accepted this mission. Your objective: Portal disruption. Alternate: Rikti capture/defeat<br><br>I'm sorry<br><br>I mean, your main objective will be to disrupt the portal generation apparatus the Rikti have utilized to access this world. That will cut off Rikti access to that dimension, or at least disrupt any possible corridors from that world to the Rikti homeworld. If those devices have been hidden too well, you can also concentrate on hunting down all Rikti operatives present."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P194049944" "Disrupt Rikti portals"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P396488928" "Your main objective is to disrupt the portal generation apparatus the Rikti have utilized to access this world. If those devices have been hidden too well, you can also concentrate on hunting down all Rikti operatives present."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3063604977" "You would hate to see the quiet streets of this world afire with the discharge from Rikti plasma cannons."

