// ModelDisplayName :
"P3946925652" "Reluctant Lost"
// Description :
"P243210353" "Lost to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P837172382" "Free the last reluctant Lost"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1912145458" "You're here to save us, {Rescuer}? Even after what we've become?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1559026434" "I thought we were beyond help. Thank you, {Rescuer}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2872871089" "Don't want: hurt people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2813732484" "Was once: A man..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1328997950" "You rescued all of the reluctant Lost before they were moved and converted into full Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2113005093" "You were unable to rescue all of the reluctant Lost before they were moved and converted into full Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2039826437" "You did very well, {HeroName}, and have my continued thanks. I went outside my own authority and ensured sufficient media coverage of your action to insure that the Lost you rescued will receive proper medical and social attention instead of being consigned to government or scientific study. <br><br>I can feel their thoughts at the edge of my perception. They are scared, but much happier. They think highly of your courage and compassion, as do I. <br><br>I also appreciate your discretion in this matter."
// RandomFameString :
"P998214927" "I saw a report about you saving those poor people the Rikti had mutated. You're a good person, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2599827533" "Several Lost escaped successfully. They are being treated now in government labs. I do not feel certain of their future, but they will not be used as unarmored disposable troops against their homeworld. I thank you for your efforts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1988207508" "Portal Corporation scientists have detected two transits to an alternate dimension. The first matches the signature of the portal technology the Rikti stole from Portal Corporation. The second is based on a different technology and would not have been detected had the scientists not been monitoring. Both originated from this world, however. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I have been authorized to ask you to stop the Rikti transdimensional expedition and discover the identity of the other expedition we detected.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1582735337" "Stop the Rikti expedition and discover the identity of the second expedition"
// SendOffString :
"P3488266908" "The world you will be traveling to is relatively uncharted. Dimensional probes have revealed that it is not a hostile environment. Your goal will be to disrupt the Rikti portals on site to ensure that that world is cut off from the Rikti homeworld, and to find out the identity of the second group to transit over to that world."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3000109484" "Disrupt Rikti expedition"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2696497652" "Your goal will be to disrupt the Rikti portals on site to ensure that that world is cut off from the Rikti homeworld, and to find out the identity of the second group to transit over to that world."

