// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2686430037" "The Rikti will not be able to continue their search from that world, and the adjustments you made should prevent further interaction between that world and ours. Though it is unlikely that the Rikti would return to such a hostile location, the full capabilities of that world's Devouring Earth population are unknown. <br><br>The Devouring Earth overran that world at approximately the same time as the first Rikti Invasion occurred in our world. These events were not linked, but the proximity of their occurrence prevented us from offering any aid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti_KillTask11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P286848001" "The battle against the Rikti forces on Earth continues. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>While stopping the long-terms plans of the Rikti is vital, it is also important to harass and destroy Rikti forces at every opportunity.</A> I have been asked to request your continued assistance in the battle with Rikti forces due to your past successes."
// AcceptString :
"P2742269477" "Harass and destroy Rikti forces at every opportunity"
// SendOffString :
"P660050650" "You may exercise your sanction against any Rikti target at any opportunity. The continued pressure from a hero of your stature should be more than sufficient, regardless of its time or place."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1337383186" "Harass Rikti forces"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1560943224" "You may exercise your sanction against any Rikti target at any opportunity. The continued pressure form a hero of your stature should be more than sufficient, regardless of its time or place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4161579095" "You've done enough damage to the Rikti for the time being."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P559744319" "My superiors would like to extend their thanks. The menace the Rikti still pose to the safety and security of humanity cannot be overstated, and it would not be possible to combat them effectively without the support of the meta-human community."
// RandomFameString :
"P4163511822" "The world will be free of the Rikti soon with heroes like you fighting them, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti_KillTask12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3889678752" "The Rikti forces remaining on Earth have been rallying themselves around their crashed vessel. Our forces are trying to keep the situation contained, with the help of Vanguard, but until new weapons are available, it is uncertain that appropriate force can be brought to bear through military means. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Thus, the government has authorized me to request you to battle the Rikti in the Rikti War Zone.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4269321336" "Battle the Rikti in the War Zone"
// SendOffString :
"P1032910869" "The crashed vessel in this area and the surrounding territory is a strong point of the remaining Rikti forces. Breaking their hold in this area will help to end their continued aggression. It is a long term goal, but a vitally important one."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P184056267" "Battle Rikti in the War Zone"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P485395838" "The crashed vessel in this area and the surrounding territory is a strong point of the Rikti forces. Breaking their hold in this area will help to control their continued aggression. It is a long term goal, but a vitally important one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3017676809" "You have defeated enough Rikti to help the human forces in the area."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2249014708" "The Rikti conflict won't end for some time, but each defeat they suffer, each soldier we capture or incapacitate is another step toward victory. Many people have sacrificed greatly to stop the Rikti threat, and I am glad to see that you take that threat seriously."
// RandomFameString :
"P1200718242" "I know we'll beat the Rikti soon, {HeroName}, now that you've started fighting them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Rikti_KillTask13 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Orders 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P404742815" "Written Rikti orders"
// DetailString :
"P3400157993" "You found this sheet of clear plastic with alien writing on it after a battle with some Rikti troops. It's most likely a set of orders for their soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1780172696" "I have recently discovered that the Rikti have begun to fear that someone is listening in on their mental network. I cannot verify if this is true, but I have not been made aware of any such breakthrough at this time. To counteract this potential threat, the Rikti commanders have started issuing false commands and issuing coded written orders to confirm which commands are true. The Rikti are unused to intricate battlefield deceptions, however, and this could be used to our advantage. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could capture one of these communications from a Rikti soldier in the field, it could help in counter-intelligence programs against them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2991753184" "Capture a communication from a Rikti soldier in the field"
// SendOffString :
"P2914503704" "You must concentrate your search in the Rikti War Zone. It is believed that the Rikti have started implementing this system in that zone only. The Rikti may have left themselves vulnerable by trying to protect themselves. If our experts can get enough samples of Rikti orders, it could allow them to break Rikti codes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4077488858" "Search for Rikti in War Zone"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3632987396" "You must concentrate your search in the Rikti War Zone. It is believed that the Rikti have started implementing this system in that zone only."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P670778017" "You found what appear to be some written orders on one of the defeated Rikti soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1936798105" "Thank you for delivering this communication. It appears to be in a new code, but as more samples are gathered, decryption should become possible. What may be even more important is that the Rikti believe that their mental communication network has become compromised. This would entail not only an agency with operatives who could listen in, but who could also understand Rikti communication and break the secure command languages. That is beyond the ability of any agency I am aware of."
